  "caption_en": "Recorded routes, local position detail and external-filter errors. Rows represent nominal walking, large body motion and antenna obstruction. Left: complete reference and LegSA-GINS paths; arrows show body heading and the purple ring locates the detail. Middle: a 0.2-second view in centimetres, referred to the reference position at its centre; circles denote its first epoch. Right: retained horizontal errors of LegSA-GINS and dual-position IEKFs over the same 16-second neighbourhood; shading denotes the middle-panel interval. The first two centres lie at the temporal midpoint during motion; the third lies at the midpoint of the first registered obstruction and is nearly stationary. Centre selection uses reference motion only; axes preserve equal spatial scale.",
  "caption_zh": "三场景的完整路线、局部空间误差与外部滤波误差。左列保留参考与本文全部轨迹，箭头表示机身航向，紫圈定位中列路段；中列放大0.2秒轨迹，以中心时刻参考位置为原点、单位厘米，圆圈为该片段首时刻；右列在同一16秒邻域展示本文与双位置IEKF文献/标定参数的原始水平误差，浅带为中列区间。前两场景采用评价窗中点的运动时刻，第三场景采用首个登记遮挡中点、当时参考位置近乎静止。中心选择仅依据参考运动，空间轴保持等比例。",
